sequenceDiagram
    actor Integrator
    participant Consumer as Consumer coordinator
    participant Owner as RunOwner / OwnedRun
    participant Provider as Selected native provider
    participant Store as Retained files
    participant Evaluator as Python evaluator
    Integrator->>Consumer: Select trusted profile and workload
    Consumer->>Owner: start(profileId, runId)
    Owner->>Owner: Reserve ID, admit immutable closure and deadline
    alt Admission rejected
        Owner-->>Consumer: Error, release reservation, no provider effects
    else Admission accepted
        Owner->>Provider: Load bindings, ready(signal)
        alt Startup or readiness fails
            Provider-->>Owner: Error / missing observed readiness
            Owner-->>Consumer: RunStartupError with retained OwnedRun
            Note over Consumer,Owner: Startup failure calls finish without hooks, finish is cached
            Note over Owner,Provider: Resources and ID stay reserved until explicit export recovery
            opt Consumer recovers available startup evidence
                Consumer->>Owner: retryExport(exportEvidence)
                Owner->>Consumer: Persist evidence through callback
                Owner->>Provider: Dispose acquired resources
                Owner->>Provider: verifyCleanup(signal)
                Provider-->>Owner: Observed release and references / failure
                Owner-->>Consumer: Error completion, previous diagnostics remain
                Note over Consumer,Owner: The original RunStartupError.completion stays an incomplete snapshot
            end
        else Native readiness observed
            Provider-->>Owner: ready + exact evidence references
            Owner-->>Consumer: OwnedRun in ready phase
            Consumer->>Owner: beginMeasurement()
            Note over Consumer,Owner: Marks the phase, the consumer starts workload and recorder
            Consumer->>Provider: Run native workload and collect observations
            Consumer->>Owner: finish(CompletionHooks)
            Owner->>Consumer: closeMeasurement, captureLastState, drainRecorders
            Consumer->>Provider: Close window, snapshot, drain native recorder
            Provider-->>Consumer: Exact payload references / stage diagnostics
            Consumer-->>Owner: Callback results
            Owner->>Consumer: exportEvidence(signal)
            Consumer->>Store: Persist payloads and verified references
            alt Export fails or returns no references
                Consumer-->>Owner: Export error
                Owner-->>Consumer: incomplete, resources and ID retained
                opt Consumer explicitly retries after fixing export
                    Consumer->>Owner: retryExport(exportEvidence)
                    Owner->>Consumer: exportEvidence(signal)
                    Consumer->>Store: Retry persistence
                    Consumer-->>Owner: References or export error
                    Note over Consumer,Owner: Successful retry still reports error, prior export error is retained
                end
            else Export returns retained references
                Consumer-->>Owner: Nonempty retained references
            end
            opt Export succeeded
                Owner->>Provider: Dispose acquired resources through Fiber effects
                Owner->>Provider: verifyCleanup(signal)
                Provider-->>Owner: Observed release and evidence / cleanup failure
                Note over Owner,Provider: Release ID requires DISPOSED + attempted/released outcomes + evidence
                Owner-->>Consumer: RunCompletion, earlier errors remain recorded
                Consumer->>Evaluator: Evaluate retained documents and facts
                Evaluator-->>Consumer: Qualification result / diagnostics
                Consumer-->>Integrator: Lifecycle outcome and separate qualification verdict
            end
        end
    end
